        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "> and what does it look like after this PR?\r\n\r\nAfter this PR, the crash becomes a warning in the LSP log and `vim.NIL` is replaced with `nil` (where params were expected to be absent), so the LSP flow continues normally.\r\n\r\nCurrently it replaces `vim.NIL` with `nil`, but it could just as well use `assert` instead — depending on what the end goal is.",
