        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> After this PR, the crash becomes a warning in the LSP log and `vim.NIL` is replaced with `nil`\r\n\r\n? it should fail. the point of validating against the protocol is to give more useful errors, not to silently log and attempt to workaround buggy servers.\r\n\r\nanyway, https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/40475 will perhaps fix the most salient symptom, so let's try that for awhile.\r\n\r\nclosing this PR since we need someone to carefully drive the idea and don't have time to guide it.",
